GET {{base}}/admin/facturas/por-anular
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCon.response.body.token}}

### 4.12 Marcar anulada en el SRI
PATCH {{base}}/admin/facturas/1/anular
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCon.response.body.token}}

